&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;As a Manager on the Corporate Development team, you&#39;ll help shape Coinbase&#39;s inorganic growth strategy by leading the execution of M&amp;amp;A transactions, strategic investments, and market landscaping efforts. This team partners directly with senior leadership and cross-functional stakeholders to identify and execute opportunities that advance Coinbase&#39;s mission and business objectives. You&#39;ll drive deal execution end-to-end, develop competitive intelligence that informs company and product strategy, and build relationships across the crypto ecosystem to keep Coinbase at the forefront of emerging opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead execution of mergers and acquisitions and strategic investments, including sourcing, financial analysis, due diligence coordination, and integration planning in partnership with senior team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct market research and synthesize findings into strategic recommendations that shape company and product direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop competitive intelligence on key players, analyzing relative strengths and weaknesses and translating insights into actionable implications for Coinbase&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior team members to cultivate cross-functional relationships with executives and drive high-priority strategic initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain relationships with startups, investors, and industry participants to surface new opportunities and stay ahead of market developments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen Corporate Development team operations by enhancing existing processes and contributing to recruiting and developing new team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6-8 years of experience in investment banking, top tier management consulting, corporate development, strategic finance, private equity, or venture capital&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading M&amp;amp;A or strategic investment transactions end-to-end, including financial modeling, due diligence, and deal structuring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to synthesize complex market data into clear strategic recommendations for senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS degree with deep intellectual curiosity for crypto, blockchain technology, and digital assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
