&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;As Head of Product Creative, you&#39;ll lead a multidisciplinary team of visual, motion, and illustration designers within the &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers/product-groups&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Consumer &amp;amp; Business&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Design organization. This team ensures that Coinbase&#39;s brand storytelling and visual language carry seamlessly from the first marketing touchpoint into the deepest in-app experience. You&#39;ll own creative continuity across product surfaces, partnering with Product Design, Engineering, and Marketing to ship work that delights millions of customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the creative direction and visual identity of the Coinbase consumer product, setting the north star for how brand comes to life inside the app experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead high-impact product launch campaigns from in-app onboarding flows to GTM feature moments, ensuring a unified story from social post to product screen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive emotional connection across core product surfaces by partnering with Product Designers on UI evolutions, motion systems, and illustration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and evolve the Coinbase design language, including icons, color systems, and UI components, in collaboration with Brand Creative and Product Design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and mentor a team of visual, motion, and illustration designers, raising the quality bar through critique, shared standards, and a clear creative vision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Engineers, Product Managers, and Marketers to move quickly without sacrificing craft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years leading product-focused creative work (visual design, motion, illustration) with a portfolio demonstrating shipped, high-impact product experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of typography, layout, color theory, and composition evidenced by a body of shipped consumer product work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of presenting creative strategy to senior leadership and securing alignment across Product, Engineering, and Marketing stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing or mentoring senior designers and building scalable design team rituals (critiques, reviews, shared systems) in a remote-first environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead cross-functional creative initiatives from concept to adoption, working autonomously in ambiguous environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Figma and the Adobe Creative Suite with proficiency in prototyping tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
