&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Internal Communications shapes Coinbase&#39;s employee experience and reinforces our mission, strategy, and culture. This individual contributor role reports to the Director of Internal Communications and will serve as a strategic communications partner to Executive/senior leaders ensuring best-in-class internal communications in an AI-native company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own complex communications plans, from strategy and planning through execution and analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise leaders and partners bringing a deep understanding of the company mission, strategy and culture as well as the needs and dynamics of the team(s) you support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and execute team-wide and company-wide events (i.e. drafting presentations and talking points, advising on event flow and structure, preparing speakers, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify opportunities and build systems, including AI-enabled tools and workflows,&amp;nbsp; that uplevel and scale internal communications across a globally distributed, remote workforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure communications effectiveness using data, feedback, and experimentation to drive continuous improvements.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Internal and External Communications teammates and cross-functional partners to support proactive and reactive communications and coordinate internal issues and change management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in internal, external, or corporate communications, media/journalism, product marketing, or another writing-intensive role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with a consistent focus on clarity and brevity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with leaders and cross-functional stakeholders on communications initiatives, with examples of ability to influence stakeholders and adapt work style accordingly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to responsibly use generative AI tools and copilots in daily workflows, maintain human oversight, and deliver business-ready outputs that improve efficiency, cost, or quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilience and an even-keeled in face of organizational change, shifting priorities, and communication with a highly distributed or remote workforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills, with the ability to plan and prioritize multiple workstreams, move between strategy and hands-on execution, balance speed and quality, and develop fluency in crypto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to think and do, someone who can both generate ideas and is proactive in implementing them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to balance speed and quality, with an acute sense for what matters most in a given moment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Job ID: P77855&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
