&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Base Creative Office is the in-house creative team behind everything the &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.base.org/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Base&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; brand ships, from brand campaigns and the Powered by Base video series to Base Batches content, live events, and builder programs. As a Senior Producer, you&#39;ll own production end to end for this full portfolio, turning incoming briefs into scoped, staffed, on-time deliveries. You&#39;ll partner directly with Base Marketing, Comms, and leadership as the single point of accountability the team trusts to get it done.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end production for Base Creative Office&#39;s full portfolio, including brand campaigns, video series, case studies, social assets, and live event builds (booths, signage, merch, AV).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triage incoming creative requests, scope each into a clear brief with timeline and staffing plan, and push back plainly when a deadline doesn&#39;t match production reality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance the Creative Office team&#39;s day-to-day workload across concurrent projects so nothing gets dropped and nobody gets overloaded.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source and manage external vendors, printers, AV partners, and contractors when a project needs outside help, including on-the-ground event production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the review and approval process across brand, legal, and executive stakeholders, consolidating feedback into one clear round of revisions and shipping final assets with organized handoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build lightweight tools, workflows, and AI-assisted processes that let a small team keep pace with high-volume requests while maintaining a human final check on every deliverable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years producing brand, video, or live-event/experiential content, including running full production cycles from brief through delivery across multiple concurrent workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage simultaneous productions independently, each with its own timeline, budget, and stakeholders, and to set realistic schedules and escalate when timelines are not feasible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience producing physical and event elements (booth builds, signage, merch, AV) and managing the vendors behind them, not just video or digital assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record running stakeholder review processes across marketing, brand, legal, and executive reviewers, with demonstrated ability to consolidate feedback and drive decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working inside an in-house creative or brand team with shared resources, direct accountability to a creative lead, and ownership as a single point of contact for production delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
