&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate new blockchains, decentralized exchanges, and launchpads into the main Coinbase app to unlock more onchain assets for millions of traders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement first-party smart contracts for onchain trading primitives such as DEX aggregation and advanced order types to improve execution quality and capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale real-time data pipelines to handle 100K+ messages per second, enabling millisecond-latency processing of blockchain market data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize the trading stack end-to-end to deliver the fastest execution, most optimal fills, and most comprehensive asset coverage for DEX traders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive iteration on agentic-first development patterns, building self-improving software systems and tooling that accelerate team velocity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
