&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end frontend development for core crypto money movement experiences, including send, receive, and transaction status tracking across web and mobile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive measurable improvements in CUJ latency, availability, and SLOs for the payment flows you own&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build new user-facing features - such as contact management systems and real-time transaction status trackers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, design, and backend engineering to scope, prioritize, and ship projects that reduce CX contact rates and improve the customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve frontend performance bottlenecks across payment flows, reducing end-to-end latency and improving reliability for millions of users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required skills and experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of software engineering experience with deep expertise in React and React Native&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of shipping consumer-facing products end-to-end in a high-scale environment, with a focus on performance, reliability, and user experience&lt;/li&gt;
