&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;As a Frontend Software Engineer on the Financial Services &amp;amp; Loyalty team within the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers/product-groups&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Consumer &amp;amp; Business&lt;/a&gt; group, you&#39;ll build and ship the user-facing experiences that power Coinbase&#39;s card, payments, and loyalty products for millions of customers. This team owns the end-to-end frontend for products like the Coinbase One credit card, crypto-back rewards, and consumer payment flows. You&#39;ll own features from technical design through production release, working closely with product, design, and backend engineering to deliver fast, reliable, and intuitive experiences that drive activation and retention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end frontend development across web and mobile for financial services products using React and React Native, including card onboarding, rewards, transactions, and payment flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build new features that expand the value proposition of Coinbase&#39;s loyalty and card products, shipping high-quality code that directly impacts customer engagement and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive experimentation and funnel optimization efforts that measurably improve conversion, activation, and retention across key user journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with product, design, and backend engineering to translate requirements into polished, performant frontend experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve frontend performance bottlenecks, contributing to measurable improvements in CUJ latency and availability SLOs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of software engineering experience, with a strong focus on frontend development using React and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of owning features end to end, from technical design through implementation, testing, and production release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with experimentation frameworks and funnel optimization, with the ability to instrument, measure, and iterate on user-facing flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to collaborate cross-functionally with product, design, and backend engineering teams to deliver features on time and at high quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
